  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">為刷子添加標準化的原版工具階級。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/777/293/brushes.png\" alt=\"銅、鐵、金、鑽石與下界合金刷子\" width=\"717\" height=\"144\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>銅刷子（原版）</strong>：64 點耐久</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>鐵刷子</strong>：135 點耐久</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>金刷子</strong>：53 點耐久</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>鑽石刷子</strong>：220 點耐久</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>下界合金刷子</strong>：436 點耐久</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">功能已完整。這些刷子非常適合原版增強類的遊戲流程。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">點擊下方連結，在結帳時使用代碼 \"<strong>JACKBUSTERS</strong>\" 可享伺服器託管服務 <strong>25%</strong> 折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fjackbusters%253fr%253dMore%2bBrushes%2bCurseForge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/ba99da02-fd57-4ccc-89a5-9a5bba0922d2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>模組包政策：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;您可以自由地將此模組包含在任何發佈於 CurseForge 的模組包中。</p>",
